Subject: [PATCH 67/67] PC5: the instructions the console refuses in programs (SGDT,
 SIDT, SLDT, SMSW, STR) are emulated, and a 32-bit game's aligned allocation
 stays below 4 GiB (Wine patches 0944, 0953)

